{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "171 is a voice call service. You record and play messages by phone, so it needs no data connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "171は音声通話のサービスです。電話で伝言を録音・再生するため、データ通信は必要ありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tsunami advisory also means get out of the sea and away from the shore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "津波注意報でも、海から上がって海岸を離れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A typhoon raises the sea level, and the sea can flood the coast.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "台風で海面が上がり、海水が沿岸に流れ込むことがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "約%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the last message, press 3 to add your own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最後の伝言のあと、3を押すと伝言を追加で録音できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the tone, speak for up to 30 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合図の音のあと、30秒以内で話します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Maps": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Area Too Large": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範囲が広すぎます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At Alert Level 3, older people and others who need time leave dangerous places. At Alert Level 4, everyone does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警戒レベル3で高齢の方など避難に時間がかかる人が、警戒レベル4で全員が、危険な場所から避難します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attributions": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avalanche": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雪崩危険箇所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avalanche (Hazard Site)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雪崩（危険箇所）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "戻る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you evacuate, switch off the breaker and close the gas valve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避難する前にブレーカーを切り、ガスの元栓を閉めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call 171.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "171に電話をかけます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calls from NTT East and NTT West lines are free. Other carriers set their own call charges.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NTT東日本・NTT西日本の電話からの通話料は無料です。ほかの通信事業者からの通話料は事業者ごとに異なります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キャンセル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the hazard map made by your municipality for the latest and most detailed information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最新かつ詳細な情報については各市町村が作成するハザードマップをご確認ください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chubu": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chugoku": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中国"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消去"
          }
        }
      }
    },
