      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在地"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data Download Site": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "データダウンロードサイト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data Sources": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "データの作成者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debris Flow (Warning Zone)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "土石流（土砂災害警戒区域）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Designated Shelter": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定避難所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Designated Shelters": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定避難所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disaster Management Agency": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防災庁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disaster Message Board (web171)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "災害用伝言板（web171）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disaster Message Dial": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "災害用伝言ダイヤル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disaster Message Dial (171)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "災害用伝言ダイヤル（171）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disaster Type": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "災害種別"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't breathe in ash. Wear a dust mask. If ash gets in your eyes, rinse them with water without rubbing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "火山灰を吸い込まないよう防じんマスクを着けます。目に入ったら、こすらずに水で洗い流します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't go back once you're out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一度避難したら戻らないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't rush outside. When the shaking stops, put out any flames and open a door to keep an exit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あわてて外に出ないでください。揺れが収まったら火を消し、ドアを開けて出口を確保します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't wait for Alert Level 5. It means a disaster has started or is about to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警戒レベル5を待たないでください。災害がすでに発生しているか、切迫している状況です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download Failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロードに失敗しました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download the data to use it offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフラインで使うにはデータをダウンロードしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロード日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@にダウンロード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロード中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earth science and disaster research institute": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防災科学技術研究所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earthquake": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地震"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emergency Evacuation Site": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定緊急避難場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emergency Numbers": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "緊急通報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emergency evacuation sites are where you flee to protect your life from immediate danger, and are designated per disaster type. Designated shelters are temporary places to stay until the danger has passed. In a disaster, go to an emergency evacuation site for that disaster, not a designated shelter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「指定緊急避難場所」は災害の危険から命を守るために緊急的に避難する場所で、災害種別ごとに指定されています。「指定避難所」は災害の危険がなくなるまでの一時的な避難施設です。災害発生時には、指定避難所ではなく、その災害に対応している指定緊急避難場所へ避難してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the phone number of the person in the disaster area. Landline numbers need the area code. If you are in the area, you can use your own number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被災地にいる人の電話番号を入力します。固定電話は市外局番から入力します。自分が被災地にいる場合は、自分の番号も使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evacuation Sites": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定緊急避難場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evacuation Sites (Emergency)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避難場所（指定緊急避難場所）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Family and Relief": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安否確認・支援"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fire and Ambulance": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消防・救急"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fire and Disaster Management Agency": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消防庁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
