    "Hokkaido": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "北海道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hokuriku": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "北陸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "House Collapse (Bank Erosion)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家屋倒壊等（河岸侵食）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "House Collapse (Overflow)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家屋倒壊等（氾濫流）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a large fire threatens your area, call out to people nearby and go to an emergency evacuation site for large fires.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大規模な火災の危険が迫ったら、周りに声をかけ、大規模な火事に対応した指定緊急避難場所へ避難します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If going outside is already dangerous, move to an upper floor or the safest place close by.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外に出るのがすでに危険なときは、上の階など、近くの少しでも安全な場所へ移動します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it erupts while you're on the mountain, descend at once, or shelter in a hut or behind a rock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登山中に噴火したら、すぐに下山するか、避難小屋や岩陰に隠れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you can't leave, go to the highest floor, on the side away from the slope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避難できないときは、斜面と反対側の、できるだけ上の階へ移動します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a lift, stop at the nearest floor and get off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エレベーターでは、最寄りの階で止めて降ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a sediment disaster warning zone, leave by Alert Level 4.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "土砂災害警戒区域では、警戒レベル4までに避難します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In smoke, cover your mouth and nose with a cloth and stay low.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "煙の中では、布で口と鼻を覆い、姿勢を低くします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inland Flood": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内水氾濫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inland Flooding": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内水（雨水出水）浸水想定区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inland Flooding (Stormwater)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内水浸水想定（雨水出水）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inundation": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浸水"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It also uses a phone number as the key. Messages left on 171 can be checked on web171, and the other way round.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "web171も電話番号をキーにします。171の伝言はweb171で、web171の伝言は171で確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It opens when a disaster makes calls to the area hard to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "災害で被災地への電話がつながりにくくなったときに提供されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARTIC Road Traffic": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARTIC 道路交通情報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JMA Disaster Information": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "気象庁 防災情報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JMA Earthquake Activity": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "気象庁 地震の活動状況"
          }
        }
      }
    },
