    "NTT sets the limits for each disaster, with at most 20 messages per phone number. Messages are kept until the service closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "条件は災害ごとにNTTが決めます。伝言は電話番号1件につき最大20件で、提供が終了するまで保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "National Land Numerical Information Terms": {
